    {
      "id": "outer-insets-producer",
      "conclusion": "This actual HistoryCell constructor explicitly supplies additionalContentInsets(top0,leading10,bottom0,trailing10). This is distinct from hosting margins2,0 and from feature/Gizmo margins.",
