        "12a3eb4 reads metadata slot2c to locate field7",
        "12a3ebc..12a3ec0 loads q0 from7da8ca0",
        "literal7da8ca0 doubles(0.0,10.0)",
        "12a3ec4 stp q0,q0 writes four doubles(0,10,0,10)"
